From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dolbaras <dolbaras@localhost>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 00:26:35 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] gxl_p271_v1: Amlogic S905L2 (GXLX) support

The Rombica SmartBox A2 is a p271 board with an S905L2, a GXLX chip.
GXLX is a GXL variant, but this tree takes the GXL paths only for
MESON_CPU_MAJOR_ID_GXL:

- VPU, VPP, SAR ADC and the HDMI colour depth setup treat GXLX as GXL;
- microSD (SD_EMMC port B): core phase 3 on GXLX, as the stock GXLX
  U-Boot uses; with the GXL default (2) reads fail with rx CRC errors
  at 40 MHz;
- default environment as in SlimBOX 9's U-Boot, whose Android images
  expect it: SELinux permissive, otg_device=1, frac_rate_policy=1,
  colorattribute=444,8bit and SlimBOX's storeargs/storeboot boot
  arguments (system-as-root).
